	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>お！　さっそく　きたか！▼
おはん　つよそーやね！
ほな　はじめよーかい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-16T07:20:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>お！　さっそく　きたか！▼
おはん　強そーやね！
ほな　はじめよーかい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-16T07:20:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posイベント
　GRIDX＝？？？、GRIDZ＝？？？で起動
　水中から飛び出してくる（要相談）
・戦闘前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:32:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:33:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おはん　つよそーじゃなく
わっせ　つよいんじゃな！▼
おいも　たまげたよ！
……って　おお　そうじゃ！▼
おどろきの　あまり　わすれてたが
これを　わたさないと　ダメじゃな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:34:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おはん　強そーじゃなく
わっせ　強いんじゃな！▼
おいも　たまげたよ！
……って　おお　そうじゃ！▼
驚きの　あまり　忘れてたが
これを　渡さないと　ダメじゃな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:34:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:33:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]は　シズイから
ウェーブバッジを　もらった！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T07:45:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]は　シズイから
ウェーブバッジを　もらった！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T07:45:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
