			<Comment>♂
・ファンファーレ＋バッジ入手処理</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:33:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
