	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それは　ウェーブバッジ！▼
イッシュちほうの　あたらしい
ジムバッジじゃ！　きれいじゃろ？▼
で　ジムバッジが　８こ　あるんなら
どんな　ポケモンとでも　なかよしだ！▼
えーっと
わざマシンも　わたすんじゃな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:16:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それは　ウェーブバッジ！▼
イッシュ地方の　あたらしい
ジムバッジじゃ！　きれいじゃろ？▼
で　ジムバッジが　８個　あるんなら
どんな　ポケモンとでも　仲良しだ！▼
えーっと
わざマシンも　渡すんじゃな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:19:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理
　No382「わざマシン５５」（ねっとう）</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T09:12:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:33:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねっとうはな　つかうと　ときどき
あいてを　やけどに　するたい▼
あとな　じぶんが　こおっていても
つかえる　おとくな　わざ　たい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T09:21:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねっとうはな　使うと　ときどき
相手を　やけどに　するたい▼
あとな　自分が　こおっていても
使える　お得な　技たい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T09:21:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理後
・続けてswleader8_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T09:21:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:33:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14gym0101_swleader8_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほな　いっとこかい！
ついてくると　えーよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほな　行っとこかい！
ついてくると　えーよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:21:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:16:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、水上移動でジム入り口へ
　動作モデルの追加を要相談</Comment>
